    <string name="dialog_about_body" formatted="false">Version: v2.4.4 (Build 54)\nCrafted &amp; Designed by: Chao Li\n\nTimeless is a minimalist campus schedule and class countdown tool designed with clean modern aesthetics. Ad-free, bloatware-free, and dedicated to pure punctuality.\n\nCore Features:\n• Dual Teacher/Student Adaptive Modes: Single timetable dynamically adapts to your identity.\n• All-in-One Smart Import: Extract timetables, calendars and shift notices in seconds.\n• Lockscreen &amp; Status Bar Countdown: Real-time countdown cards at a glance.\n• Pure Local Privacy &amp; Sovereignty: 100% on-device SQLite storage with one-tap JSON backup &amp; migration.</string>

