    <string name="guide_role_card_title">Teacher Mode vs Student Mode: What\'s the Difference?</string>
    <string name="guide_role_card_desc">Timeless is crafted for students and faculty alike. Using a single timetable, it intelligently adapts the view to match your perspective:\n\n• 👨‍🏫 Teacher Mode (For Instructors):\nHome shows \"Today\'s Teaching\", highlighting class names &amp; student numbers. Strong anti-overtime vibration alerts trigger 5 minutes before class ends, plus one-tap manual teaching session starts.\n\n• 🎓 Student Mode (For Students):\nHome shows \"Today\'s Classes\", prominently displaying classroom locations &amp; professors so you never wander into the wrong building or hall. Full support for recess/break transitions and focus study timers.\n\n💡 Tip: Teachers and students use the exact same app. Switch roles anytime in Settings with instant local synchronization.</string>

    <string name="guide_schedule_ai_title">Option A: All-in-One Smart Import (Recommended)</string>
    <string name="guide_schedule_ai_desc">Tap the \"+\" action button on the Home or Calendar screen to import portal screenshots, calendar notices, or pasted announcement texts. The multimodal engine extracts semesters, courses and shift rules in seconds!</string>

    <string name="guide_schedule_manual_title">Option B: Offline Manual Scheduling (No Network Needed)</string>
    <string name="guide_schedule_manual_desc">No internet or API key required. Timeless provides full offline manual scheduling:\n\n1. 【Period Table】: In Mine → Period Times Table, tweak start and end times to match your school (preloaded with 10 standard periods).\n2. 【Add Course】: Go to the \"Timetable\" tab and tap \"+\" to manually add course names, classrooms, professors, and periods.\n3. 【Calendar &amp; Tasks】: In the \"Calendar\" tab, tap \"+\" to schedule exams, meetings, or personal to-dos.</string>

    <string name="guide_clock_card_title">Class Rhythms at a Glance · Lockscreen &amp; Notifications</string>
    <string name="guide_clock_card_desc">• Lock Screen Card: Check current period countdown and progress bar without waking up your screen.\n• Foreground Status Capsule: When in class, the status bar and notifications dynamically display your live countdown.\n• Punctuality Warning: 5 minutes before class finishes (customizable in Settings), a distinct vibration helps you wrap up smoothly.</string>

    <string name="guide_privacy_card_title" formatted="false">100% Local Storage &amp; Complete Privacy</string>
    <string name="guide_privacy_card_desc" formatted="false">• Local Only: All schedules, courses, and to-do items are stored 100% in your device\'s local SQLite database. Nothing ever leaves your phone.\n• Effortless Backup &amp; Migration: Tap \"Export Backup\" in Settings to save a JSON file or share it via chat apps. Switch to a new device and restore your entire semester in a second.</string>
